OL,3,ANetherlands pulls out of Eurovision
OL,4,Aagain over Israel participation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Netherlands has pulled out of next
OL,7,Fyear's Eurovision Song Contest, with
OL,8,Fpublic broadcaster NPO citing
OL,9,F"sensitivities" over Israel's
OL,10,Fparticipation - reversing a previous
OL,11,Fdecision to take part.
OL,13,FThe Netherlands and four other
OL,14,Fcountries boycotted this year's event,
OL,15,Fafter Dutch network Avrotros pulled
OL,16,Fout.
OL,18,FAvrotros said it would also not take
OL,19,Fpart next year, but NPO, which oversees
OL,20,Fpublic broadcasting in the country,
OL,21,Fstepped in and pledged last month that
OL,22,Fthe country would return in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
